{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14301244","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14301244","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1430124401:1":{"text":"나도 모르겠어. 그동안 나는 감독도 하고, 깊은바위 수정 채굴지의 실상을 숨기는 일도 해왔는데...","source_cn":"我也不知道，之前我除了监工，还负责掩盖深岩晶矿区的情况……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA45670B9E819A5D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1430124402:1":{"text":"하지만 얼마 전에 드래곤이 날아서 도망치는 모습을 사람들이 봤잖아? 깊은바위 수정의 진실도 머지않아 드러나겠지.","source_cn":"可前阵子很多人都看见龙从地下飞走，深岩晶的真相早晚都会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BA27DF7DA202814","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:监工特特里":{"text":"현장 감독 테테리","source":"监工特特里","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}}